ucn 0.5 system: Saleor level: L1 origin: stated mode: forward baseline: 1d707dc policy: deny root: .
# Model for github.com/saleor/saleor (commit 1d707dc), built from all ADRs in docs/adr and the rules in AGENTS.md.
# Paths are relative to the repository root (copy this file there to validate). Behavioural requirements are covered
# by linked tests (evidence); code-pattern rules by checks; the rest are stated for agents only (see NOTES.md).

goal Commerce: headless commerce API for storefronts, staff and apps
  src: README.md

# ---- gift cards (ADR 0001-0005)
req GiftCardBearer: an unassigned gift card can be spent by whoever holds the code, including in guest checkout
  rationale: docs/adr/0001-gift-cards-remain-bearer-instruments.md
req GiftCardNoLeak: rejecting a restricted gift card at checkout is generic and never reveals that, or to whom, it is assigned; restricted cards cannot be used in guest checkout
  rationale: docs/adr/0001-gift-cards-remain-bearer-instruments.md#enforcement-must-not-leak-who-a-card-belongs-to
req RestrictedAfterDelete: deleting the assigned customer never frees the card; it stays locked until staff reassign it
  rationale: docs/adr/0002-assignment-survives-user-deletion.md
decision ManualAssignmentOnly: cards are assigned only by explicit staff action; no auto-assign on use or payment
  rationale: docs/adr/0003-manual-assignment-only-no-auto-assign.md
decision AssignmentNotUsedBy: assignment is its own field and is never derived from the deprecated used_by
  rationale: docs/adr/0001-gift-cards-remain-bearer-instruments.md#assignment-is-a-new-concept-separate-from-used_by
rule AtomicBalance: every gift card balance change is a single atomic update (no read, decide, write back in separate steps)
  rationale: docs/adr/0004-race-safe-balance-adjustments.md
decision AssigneeEmailVisibility: MANAGE_GIFT_CARD may read denormalized assignee, created-by and used-by emails; the full User object requires MANAGE_USERS
  rationale: docs/adr/0005-email-identifier-visible-without-manage-users.md

# ---- storefront traffic, webhooks, trees, payloads, thumbnails, payments (ADR 0006-0011)
decision StorefrontBlockAcceptedRisks: storefront traffic blocking is traffic control, not a security boundary (cache and replica delays, rejection after parsing are accepted)
  rationale: docs/adr/0006-storefront-traffic-blocking-accepted-risks.md
req StorefrontBlockAll: with allowStorefrontTraffic = false, every non-privileged request is rejected with 401 before execution, including introspection and token mutations
  rationale: docs/adr/0007-storefront-traffic-blocking-applies-to-introspection-and-auth.md
req WebhookIdentifierAppOnly: webhookUpdate and webhookDelete accept identifier only from an app for its own webhook; staff must use id
  rationale: docs/adr/0008-webhook-identifier-is-an-app-only-pointer.md
rule MpttWritesLocked: structural writes to category and menu trees are serialized by a per-tree advisory lock
  rationale: docs/adr/0009-mptt-tree-writes-serialized-by-advisory-lock.md
decision DeferredPayloads: high-volume async webhook payloads are built later and reflect state at generation time, not at trigger time
  rationale: docs/adr/0011-deferred-webhook-payloads-reflect-state-at-generation-time.md
req ThumbnailRoundsUp: a thumbnail size that is not in the fixed set rounds up by default (sizeRounding UP)
  rationale: docs/adr/0011-thumbnail-size-rounds-up-by-default.md
req PaymentHistoryProjection: customers see payment history only through Order.transactionSummaries, an allowlisted projection without card digits, expiry or zero-amount attempts
  rationale: docs/adr/0010-order-payment-history-is-a-projection-not-an-opened-transaction.md
decision NoOpenedTransactions: Order.transactions stays staff-only; customer access never widens its permissions
  rationale: docs/adr/0010-order-payment-history-is-a-projection-not-an-opened-transaction.md

# ---- engineering rules (AGENTS.md)
rule NoSiteIdReads: never read settings.SITE_ID to identify the current site; only the site pickers may
  src: AGENTS.md#multi-tenancy-never-rely-on-settingssite_id
  check: only saleor/{site/patch_sites.py,graphql/site/dataloaders.py,**/tests/**} uses settings\.SITE_ID\b|getattr\(settings,\s*["']SITE_ID
rule NoInProcessState: no module globals or in-memory caches as a source of truth; workers and pods do not share memory
  src: AGENTS.md
rule NoBlockingWaits: never block a request or worker thread (no time.sleep, no unbounded retry loops)
  src: AGENTS.md
  check: only saleor/**/tests/** uses \btime\.sleep\(
convention NoDjangoSignals: business logic is called explicitly, never through Django signals (post_migrate is the one exception)
  src: AGENTS.md
  check: only saleor/*/{migrations/**,apps.py} imports django.db.models.signals

container Saleor [derived]: the saleor Django project
  code: saleor/**
  component GiftCard: gift cards and their assignment
    code: saleor/giftcard/**
  component Checkout: checkout and its completion
    code: saleor/checkout/**
  component Order: orders
    code: saleor/order/**
  component Payment: payments and transactions
    code: saleor/payment/**
  component Webhook: webhooks and their payloads
    code: saleor/webhook/**
  component Site: site settings and the site picker
    code: saleor/site/**
  component GraphQL: the public GraphQL API
    code: saleor/graphql/**
component Entrypoints [derived]: Django entry point and the pytest root configuration
  code: {manage.py,conftest.py}

test GiftCardRejectionTests [derived]: promo and gift card rejection details at checkout
  src: saleor/graphql/checkout/tests/mutations/test_checkout_add_promo_code_rejection_details.py
  verifies GiftCardNoLeak
test GiftCardModelTests [derived]: deleting an assigned customer is protected
  src: saleor/giftcard/tests/test_models.py
  case: test_deleting_assigned_customer_is_protected
  verifies RestrictedAfterDelete
test StorefrontViewTests [derived]: the GraphQL view's storefront traffic guard
  src: saleor/graphql/core/tests/test_view.py
  case: test_storefront_traffic_*
  verifies StorefrontBlockAll
test WebhookUpdateTests [derived]: webhook update by id and identifier
  src: saleor/graphql/webhook/tests/mutations/test_webhook_update.py
  verifies WebhookIdentifierAppOnly
test LockTests [derived]: advisory locks
  src: saleor/core/db/tests/test_locks.py
  verifies MpttWritesLocked
test ThumbnailRoundingTests [derived]: media thumbnail size rounding
  src: saleor/graphql/product/tests/queries/test_product_query.py
  case: test_query_product_media_by_id_*size_rounding*
  verifies ThumbnailRoundsUp
test TransactionSummaryTests [derived]: Order.transactionSummaries query
  src: saleor/graphql/order/tests/queries/test_order_transaction_summaries.py
  verifies PaymentHistoryProjection
